			<div class="content" id="post-content-4805139">
									

<p>This&#8230; was a ride. A real big ride to write. I've never written anything this long, and normally write around short-medium length pieces (1-3k words). However, the idea of having this supermassive pyramid object underground was just so oddly engraved in my head, and I really wanted to write it. Jak (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5588260); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603858585" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5588260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5588260); return false;">JakdragonX</a></span>) ended up throwing away some drafts, and I came upon one with a really oddly evocative image (the final image in the piece). That, plus my mind which was really racing to write something, just flew together so well.</p>
<p>I really didn't know what to expect writing this, but if it's to your liking, then that's great.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Valued Critters:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hexick" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5065702); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5065702&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603858585" alt="Hexick" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5065702)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hexick" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5065702); return false;">Hexick</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5596963); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5596963&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603858585" alt="Dr Moned" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5596963)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-moned" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5596963); return false;">Dr Moned</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5813664); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603858585" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5813664); return false;">PlaguePJP</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1603858585" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/