<p>Length was a concern when you were asking for crit, but honestly? This is just about perfect. Some people might object to the fact that you're portraying O5s as normal human beings and not corrupt immortal people/corrupt immortal deities/corrupt immortal etc., but honestly? Just seeing O5s <em>argue</em> outside of the context of a meeting is such a refreshing thing that gives character to entities that haven't really had any.</p>
<p>(And I am REALLY glad you cut down on the swearing&#8212; &quot;ook fucking ook&quot; is a great line, but it doesn't belong in this piece)</p>

